Description:
Top-starred Vercel Labs repositories fused into Google Bun:
- agent-browser: Headless browser automation protocol for AI agents.
- skills: Composable SKILL.md agent capability router.
- json-render: Streaming generative UI JSON schema compiled to Google M3, Wiz, Compose, Flutter & GPUI.
- agent-desktop: Native computer-use desktop automation.
- native & scriptc: Native desktop toolkit and TypeScript-to-Native compiler patterns.
